<h2>Who we are</h2>
<p>WFT — Websites for Tradies ("WFT", "we", "us") is a New Zealand web design service that builds websites for tradespeople. You can reach us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
<p>We handle personal information in accordance with the <strong>New Zealand Privacy Act 2020</strong> and its Information Privacy Principles.</p>

<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>The only personal information we ask you for on this website is what you type into the kickoff-call form:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>First and last name</strong> — so we know who we're speaking to.</li>
  <li><strong>Phone number</strong> — so we can call you back.</li>
  <li><strong>Your trade</strong> — so we can prepare relevant examples before the call.</li>
  <li><strong>Your suburb or area</strong> — so we understand your local market.</li>
  <li><strong>Best time to call</strong> — optional, so we don't ring you up a ladder.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not ask for your email address, date of birth, financial details, or any government identifier through this website. We never collect sensitive information as defined by the Privacy Act.</p>

<h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
<p>Like almost every website, some technical information is collected when you visit:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Pages viewed, referring page, approximate location (country/region level), device type and browser.</li>
  <li>Performance data such as how quickly pages load for you.</li>
</ul>
<p>We also record <em>that</em> a kickoff-call form was submitted, so we can tell which pages actually generate enquiries. That record contains none of the details you typed into the form.</p>
<p>All of this is aggregated analytics used to understand what's working on the site. It is not used to identify you personally.</p>

<h2>Why we collect it</h2>
<p>One reason: <strong>to call you back about building your website.</strong> That's it.</p>
<p>We do not sell your information. We do not rent it, trade it, or hand it to data brokers. We do not add you to a marketing list without you asking. If you fill in the form and then decide against it, tell us and we'll delete your details.</p>

<h2>Who else touches your information</h2>
<p>We use a small number of third-party services to run this website. Each one is listed here so you know exactly where your information goes.</p>

